From 019ae9cd77e02157f7a2fd42763a85437cc31ed3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:24:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): sessions.filter plugin area for the session
 list [daveey]

Plugins could not filter the desktop session list. Add the `sessions.filter`
contribution area (store/session-filter.ts), following `sidebarNav.prefs`:

- applySessionFilters: AND over every contribution's data.match; a match that
  is not a function or throws counts as matching (console.warn once per id).
- sessionHasOpenCards: the fields the row's card squares read.
- sidebar sessionMatchesFilters applies it after the status/profile/PR checks
  and before project navigation; sidebarFiltersNarrow takes pluginFilters so
  the 'filters on' state shows; resetSidebarView calls each onClear.
- SDK: SESSION_FILTER_AREA, SessionFilterContribution, sessionHasOpenCards,
  useSidebarSessions (core-filtered list, without plugin filters).

No change to existing filters, the filter menu or card colours.
Approved: operation 7de742f9 / request 6dec271f rev 2.
Hermes-Card: t_3fbf983dd78af293
